    title: "taint return lift: an expression-bodied callable returns its value with no return statement, so a rust tail expression / JS-TS arrow body helper is still a false all-clear (INV-komoj residual)"  # d83a
    status: todo_hard  # d83a
    priority: 2  # d83a
